%% 飞书借鉴点增量 · 6 个核心时序
%% 统一跳转入口：BoardRoom.jumpToEntry(id) = 设 anchorEntryIds + setActiveTab('speech')

%% ① 全局搜索跳转高亮（P0-①）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant SB as SearchBar
    participant S as useBoardSearch
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant TP as TranscriptPanel(发言区)
    participant SM as StructuredMinutes
    participant MM as MindMap
    participant CP as CommentaryPanel

    U->>SB: 输入关键词（防抖 200ms / ⌘K 聚焦）
    SB->>S: query
    S->>S: 扁平化检索 entries + structuredRefined + mindmap + commentaries
    S-->>SB: SearchResult[] 分组（发言区/纪要/导图/点评）
    U->>SB: 点击某结果 / ↑↓ + Enter
    SB->>BR: jumpTo(result)
    alt kind = entry
        BR->>BR: jumpToEntry(targetId)
        BR-->>TP: anchorEntryIds=[id] + activeTab='speech'
        TP->>TP: scrollIntoView + .anchor-hl
    else kind = minutes-paragraph
        BR->>BR: setActiveTab('smart') + minutesScrollTarget=id
        BR-->>SM: scrollTargetId=id → 滚动 + 高亮该段
    else kind = mindmap-node
        BR->>BR: setActiveTab('smart') + mindmapScrollTarget=title
        BR-->>MM: 外层 MindMapDrill 滚动到 .mm-title 并高亮
    else kind = commentary
        BR->>CP: onAnchor(c) → 切发言区 + 锚点
    end

%% ② 结构化纪要渲染（P0-②，消费 B1）
sequenceDiagram
    participant E as useTranscriptEnhance
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant SM as StructuredMinutes
    participant B1 as 后端 refine(B1)

    B1-->>E: structured: StructuredMinutes + keywords
    E-->>BR: structuredRefined / keywords
    BR->>SM: data=structuredRefined, highlightTerm, onJumpToEntry
    SM->>SM: 渲染章节折叠标题
    SM->>SM: 段落（结论句 .conclusion-hl 高亮）
    SM->>SM: ✅行动项子区块（owner/due + 来源按钮）
    SM->>SM: 顶部关键词区渲染 keywords
    Note over SM: 空态沿用「AI 整理版生成中…」

%% ③ 标签筛选聚合（P1-④）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant TF as TagFilterBar
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant TP as TranscriptPanel(发言区)

    U->>TF: 点击 [🟢结论] / [全部]
    TF->>BR: setActiveTagFilter('conclusion')
    BR->>BR: 过滤 entries（entryTags[id] 含该标签）
    BR->>TP: entries=过滤后 + decorations.tags
    TP->>TP: 仅渲染命中条成清单；条目前彩色标签条

%% ④ 划词工具条（P1-⑦）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant ST as SelectionToolbar
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant CP as CommentaryPanel

    U->>ST: 选中文字（mouseup）
    ST->>ST: 定位浮动 [高亮|评论|引用]
    alt 高亮
        U->>ST: 点「高亮」
        ST->>BR: 写 highlights（会话常驻）
    else 评论
        U->>ST: 点「评论」→ 输入
        ST->>BR: 写 userCommentaries
        BR-->>CP: extraCommentaries（新增可选 prop）
    else 引用
        U->>ST: 点「引用」
        ST->>BR: 进 ExcerptCard 草稿
    end

%% ⑤ 导图节点下钻跳转（P1-⑥，消费 B2）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant MD as useMindMapDrill(DOM 委托)
    participant MM as MindMap(不变)
    participant DR as MindMapDrill
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant TP as TranscriptPanel(发言区)

    U->>MM: 点击某节点
    MM-->>MD: 捕获 .mm-row 点击（不改 MindMap）
    MD->>DR: 打开浮层（节点 entryIds + 大咖观点）
    U->>DR: 点某来源条目
    DR->>BR: jumpToEntry(entryId)
    BR->>BR: jumpToEntry → anchorEntryIds + activeTab='speech'
    BR-->>TP: scrollIntoView + .anchor-hl

%% ⑥ 发言占比条计算与筛选（P2-②，前端算）
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant QB as SpeechQuotaBar
    participant BR as BoardRoom
    participant TP as TranscriptPanel(发言区)

    BR-->>QB: entries + roles（含 isBigShot）
    QB->>QB: 按角色累加计时长（相邻 speech 间隔；opinion 计入对应角色）
    QB-->>QB: 渲染按角色着色占比段（大咖AI 置顶）
    U->>QB: 点击某角色段
    QB->>BR: setActiveRoleFilter(roleId) + jumpToRole
    BR->>BR: 过滤 entries 为该角色 + 滚动到首条
    BR-->>TP: 渲染该角色发言清单
